  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening Indonesia&#x2019;s Education Ecosystem through Strategic Engagement with UK Education Providers</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This is a research study to explore how UK education providers can support Indonesia&#x2019;s education ecosystem. The study will strengthen UK&#x2013;Indonesia education 
cooperation by aligning British education models with Indonesia&#x2019;s national education goals, inform policy cooperation, and support inclusive, high-quality learning.</narrative>
  </description>
